# The Wi-Fi's saved networks in ネットワーク設定 (docs/tessronos/09-network.md 9.6.6, 9.6.7;
# 11-desktop.md), for tools/ui_run.py with the kernel of make TARGET=_QEMU_VIRT_ DESKTOP=1
# UITEST=1 WIFI=1 and the test disk of a KTEST=1 WIFI=1 build. QEMU has no Wi-Fi card: the
# UI test's wifitest gives the Wi-Fi manager a card for the tests, with a scan's four networks
# (one of them DIRECT-42JE-HF-MS200AAH, the name that ran out of the list on the ThinkPad).
# The window of ネットワーク設定 is at 205,122, its panel's 0,0 at 205,148: the tag
# 〈Ｗｉ－Ｆｉ〉 at 437,163; 削除 at 669,256; the scan's list a row 17 high, the first row at 321;
# パスワード at 463,432; 保存 at 385,466 and 接続 at 481,466. The program reads the card
# every second while the page is shown, and takes a press a little later then: two seconds
# are left after each.
# What is seen: the list's long names cut short with "…" (shot wk_list); a network saved with
# a password as 利用者 (nobody being logged in: a network of 利用者's own), with no question for
# the administrator's password; another network of the scan chosen (wk_other), then 保存した接続
# opened at 463,256, its list open still three seconds on (wk_popup), and the saved network
# chosen in it with ↓ and Enter 0.1 s apart: its password shown as eight marks (wk_masked);
# 接続 with the marks left as they are joins as saved, with the saved key; 削除 forgets it,
# again with no question. Then WPA3-Personal and WPA2/WPA3-Personal: a network saved with a
# password as WPA3 and joined by SAE with it, the pop-up of セキュリティ with its four choices
# (wk_secpop, wk_wpa3, wk_wpa2wpa3).
# Then 表示の倍率 150%, set in システム環境設定 as tools/tests/ui_scale.steps sets it, a second
# ネットワーク設定 opened in front of it at the same place, and the list again (wk_list150).
# The places are the view's pixels, the same at every scale.
wifitest
expect wifi: test card ready
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
expect netenv: ready
wait 800
click 437 163
expect netenv: scan 4 networks, 4 shown
wait 2000
shot wk_list
# TessronOS-Test, the first row: its SSID and WPA2 into the parts
click 505 321
wait 2000
click 463 432
wait 1000
text secret-pass1
wait 2000
click 385 466
expect wifi: saved a network, a new key: 0
expect netenv: wifi changed
wait 2000
shot wk_saved
# another network of the scan (not saved: an empty password), then the one saved again:
# eight marks for its password
click 505 338
wait 2000
shot wk_other
# 保存した接続 opened: its list stays open while the program reads the card every second
# (three seconds: three readings), and the saved network is chosen in it with ↓ and Enter a
# tenth of a second apart, as quickly as a person types them
click 463 256
wait 3000
shot wk_popup
key 51
wait 100
key 28
expect netenv: saved network chosen
wait 2000
shot wk_masked
click 481 466
expect netenv: wifi joined as saved
expect wifi: test: joining "TessronOS-Test", with the saved key
wait 2000
# forgotten, with no question
click 669 256
expect wifi: forgot a network: 0
wait 2000
shot wk_forgot
# WPA3-Personal: Office-WPA3-Only typed in ＳＳＩＤ (at 463,289; the scan's list shows three rows
# of its four), WPA3-Personal chosen in the pop-up of セキュリティ (at 463,394) with ↓ and Enter
# (its four choices open: shot wk_secpop), a password typed and saved: the kernel keeps the
# password for SAE (shot wk_wpa3), and 接続 with the marks left joins by SAE with it
click 463 289
wait 1000
text Office-WPA3-Only
wait 1000
click 463 394
wait 1500
shot wk_secpop
key 51
wait 100
key 28
wait 1500
click 463 432
wait 1000
text wpa3-secret-9
wait 1500
shot wk_wpa3
click 385 466
expect wifi: saved a network, a new key: 0 (wpa3)
expect netenv: wifi changed
wait 2000
click 481 466
expect netenv: wifi joined as saved
expect wifi: test: joining "Office-WPA3-Only", by SAE with the saved password
wait 2000
# WPA2/WPA3-Personal, the next choice of the pop-up, a password typed over the marks and saved:
# both the PMK and the password kept
click 463 394
wait 1500
key 51
wait 100
key 28
wait 1500
click 463 432
wait 1000
text wpa3-secret-9
wait 1500
click 385 466
expect wifi: changed a network, a new key: 0 (wpa2wpa3)
wait 2000
shot wk_wpa2wpa3
click 481 466
expect wifi: test: joining "Office-WPA3-Only", with the saved key, by SAE with the saved password
wait 2000
click 669 256
expect wifi: forgot a network: 0
wait 2000
# 表示の倍率 150%
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 206 181
wait 300
click 706 184
expect sysenv: screen scale 100%, 3 scales
wait 500
click 658 455
wait 300
click 658 495
wait 300
click 706 554
expect wm: drawn at 150% (was 100%)
wait 1500
key 28
expect drawn at 150%, kept
wait 1500
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
expect netenv: ready
wait 1500
click 437 163
wait 2500
shot wk_list150
absent !OACV!
